                        "username": "raviteja-b"
                    },
                    "message": "please push a design doc to explain use-case and proposed design (or update existing networkd design) since it has major impact on Networkd Design/implementation"
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/bond.cpp",
                    "line": 37,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ravi Teja",
                        "email": "raviteja28031990@gmail.com",
                        "username": "raviteja-b"
                    },
                    "message": "Network Bond can be generic implementation but looks like this implementation tightly couples the network daemon to a specific IPMI provider layout"
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/bond.cpp",
